#==============================================================================================
#
#   event_handler_2 - Web::EventHandler: wheel events, chrome widgets, pointer events and the
#   legacy mouse events they map to, hover, cursors, clicks, activation, context menus and the
#   tracking state
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Page/EventHandler.cpp lines 567-1003 (handle_mousewheel through
#       clear_per_test_input_state). The UI events (MouseEvent, PointerEvent, WheelEvent) these
#       functions create come with the UIEvents region; until then their creation traps.
